<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-4367] Streaming tables are not working anymore</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-4367</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Just execute the following paragraph (as explained [here|&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2809&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2809&lt;/a&gt;]):&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;```&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;{{%sh&lt;br/&gt;
echo &quot;%table&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
echo &quot;Col1	Col2&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
echo &quot;1	2&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
sleep 1&lt;br/&gt;
echo &quot;3	4&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
echo &quot;5	6&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
sleep 2&lt;br/&gt;
echo &quot;7	8&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
sleep 3&lt;br/&gt;
echo &quot;9	10&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
echo &quot;11	12&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
sleep 4&lt;br/&gt;
echo &quot;12	13&quot;}}&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;```&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Current behaviour:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/nL1SW0Z.gif&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Expected behaviour:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/674497/36419469-fa4c26e0-1657-11e8-8a8a-717b29d91771.gif&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
